SUMMARY:Weekly case review: Full-thickness rectal prolapse with fecal incon
 tinence
DESCRIPTION:Vacation rule: optional\; skip without catch-up guilt\nVacation
  target: 10 new SCORE questions\, then enjoy the day\nSCORE phase: Full qu
 estion-bank pass\nModules: Hemorrhoids\; Procedures for Hemorrhoids\; Anal
  Dysplasia and STDs\; Perianal Condylomas Excision\; Fecal Incontinence\;
  Rectal Prolapse\; Rectal Prolapse Repair\nAnki: 10 minutes\; make up to 3
  cards from missed or guessed questions\nCase: Full-thickness rectal prola
 pse with fecal incontinence\nOperation: Hemorrhoidectomy\nAnatomy: Anal ca
 nal\, sphincter complex\, and hemorrhoidal columns\nComplication: Post-hem
 orrhoidectomy bleeding\nAnswer: What do I do first? What changes managemen
 t? When do I call for help?\nCapture one pearl\, one uncertainty\, and one
  follow-up topic
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
